+\paragraph{Receipt verification and authentication scope.}
+The recovered source at the original declared revisions distinguishes native
+receipt content integrity from producer authentication. Canonical hashes bind
+receipt fields and checks compare supplied invocation context, roots, and time;
+these functions do not verify a producer signature or discharge the referenced
+proof obligations. The separate UCAN path performs Ed25519 authorization checks,
+and its token signature is not a signature over the datasets decision receipt.
+The selected harness constructs the receipt directly after its host Boolean
+and UCAN gates; this does not demonstrate execution of the full native evidence
+selection and decision service. Its forged-receipt control substitutes a literal
+invalid string and does not establish rejection of an attacker-authored,
+self-consistent receipt with recomputed unkeyed identifiers.
+
+The receipt-derived datasets capability and the signed UCAN are distinct
+objects. The archived enforcer permits a receipt-based consumption fallback
+when datasets capability derivation fails; the selected A4 route still requires
+its separate UCAN gate. Generic capability attenuation/fallback limits found
+in source are not observed failures of the retained benchmark cases.
+
+Receipt freshness is checked against a supplied frozen logical clock and
+symbolic root labels in this harness. These probes do not attest a live root
+registry or ambient wall-clock freshness of the datasets receipt; the UCAN path
+has separate token timing checks. Consume-before-dispatch and a one-time marker
+also do not prove atomic or exactly-once arbitrary external effects. Historical
+source-pin recovery is distinct from per-worker imported-module attestation.
+
+\paragraph{CVE-specific interpretation.}
+Retained automated source contracts and source differences do not establish
+independent vulnerable/fixed/unrelated polarity or applicability to the modeled
+export operation. A development diagnostic trace permits the declared export
+and denies an authored undeclared-effect mutation before dispatch; these are
+modeled contract outcomes, not a native CVE reproduction or new semantic label.
+The separate diagnostic traces add no primary experimental cells.
